{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"cb88f85c875f65ba89b5445fb5558b5f7cb2c2bbb949f6123a957d90912d4a16","ja":"さて、最後まで通してみましたが……\nどうでしょう、翼？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ce5b8f5e26168bf7d7cde951416065a31571d2661aecc550f3f5587e40ac4f29","ja":"……不思議です。\n台詞がスラスラでてきて……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1b3ed762ab1e2c201686a18e89f1774731d9186ba0c5d6aeeb1e8fa7f3a4c026","ja":"そうですね、失敗なくやり切れていたかと。\nさすがです、翼。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"188488495068becb4d70cb21c6bd0fa8eac34891130733060eb6b280a6e7f071","ja":"本当ですか！？　なら本番も大丈夫そう……！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6639e3bbf830eac60fd95d0819f7abea2f6b844b2a2f3d647e62be7561dfcf32","ja":"でも、どうしてわかったんです？\nわたしが、台本なくてもできるって。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0c6bd8d01411bd148ab961824066aa90025edfcfb67eebe8dfcad05c25b07a5c","ja":"ふふっ。姫たちは、ちゃ～んと見てたのですよ。\n翼ちゃんががんばってレッスンしているところを。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5f1aef2dbe3f74d198f6d40ce101da17049a37da875caeb8a11d5680423ffe20","ja":"それに、家でも自主レッスンしてたって言ってたし……\nきっと大丈夫って、思えたのです♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c6d1d9b230cc2080912c431a2cb3583a894866754b00a8054f88c38f0a379d86","ja":"貴音さん、まつりさん……。ありがとうございます♪\n本番もこの調子でがんばりますね！　えへへ♪","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"238cbf425a234b4aba8e33890a10481cfff3e3313a3ef4d735b2aeff814de5a5","ja":"おっ待たせーっ！　台本余ってたから、\n1冊もらってきたよ！　……って、3人で何してんの？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"29c7403b8d8fe503660dbcd3e2b79ff9b327483d2752682628cc66d8e0798c31","ja":"あっ、聞いてくださいよ～、恵美さん！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"fb219e4b2fb1603436e9259435f3398e7943aadc2fc0960d24251bb7974a8f76","ja":"まつりさんと貴音さんと一緒に読み合わせしたら、\n台本がなくてもバッチリだったんです～！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4661cd91616094481cb939c2bdf7a422c6be9df529510232fa9022bb8e91a67b","ja":"そっかそっかー。\nやっぱ翼はすごいね～！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"9fb2ebff1d05c75bf013ed6416394265cf3248edbdb5f204368664374c8e396c","ja":"それじゃあ、台本はいらなかったかな。\nアタシ、慌てなくても良かったみたいだね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"9f6a1c159b87166fbacd37cf431f9a908a9b122d5a45019eb7d995e9e4bca158","ja":"あ、いえ……！　やっぱり、持ってた方が安心なので、\n台本、欲しいです！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_908.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"60134f6cb28400f466e9b801e308e1e7de16c15424d46ef6e1eafc90a97bcd8b","ja":"恵美さん、台本もらって来てくれて、\nありがとうございました～！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
